### Deleting: a player cannot delete another player's character
POST {{endpoint}}/functions/character/executions
X-Appwrite-Project: {{project}}
X-Appwrite-JWT: {{jwtPlayer}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "async": false, "body": "{\"action\":\"delete\",\"characterId\":\"{{otherCharacterId}}\",\"name\":\"anything\"}" }

> {%
  client.test("only its player or the Storyteller deletes a character", () => {
    client.assert(response.body.responseStatusCode === 403, `expected 403, got ${response.body.responseStatusCode}`);
  });
%}

